sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Prefect
    participant A as Decision agent
    participant T as Tools<br/>(scorer, resolver, data)
    participant V as Plan validator
    participant S as Simulator

    P->>A: start day d (budget K)
    A->>T: get shortlist
    T-->>A: ranked hulls with scores
    loop for each unclear hull
        A->>T: check identity and history
        T-->>A: same hull? + history
    end
    A->>V: submit plan (K hulls + reasons)
    V-->>P: final plan (or scorer top-K as fallback)
    P->>S: send plan
    S-->>T: inspection results (used the next day)
